{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"氣穴論篇第五十八","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"黃帝問曰：餘聞氣穴三百六十五以應一歲，未知其所，願卒聞之。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"岐伯稽首再拜對曰：窘乎哉問也？其非精帝，孰能窮其道焉，因請溢意盡言其處。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"帝捧手逡巡而卻曰：夫子之開餘道也，目未見其處，耳未聞其數，而目已明，耳以聰矣。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"岐伯曰：此所謂精人易語，良馬易御也。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"帝曰：餘非精人之易語也，世言真數開人意，今餘所訪問者真數，發蒙解惑，未足以論也。然餘願聞夫子溢志盡言其處，令解其意，請藏之金匱，不敢復出。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"岐伯再拜而起曰：臣請言之，背與心相控而痛，所治天突與十椎及上紀。上紀者胃脘也，下紀者關元也。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"背胸邪繫陰陽左右如此，其病前後痛澀，胸脅痛而不得息，不得臥、上氣、短氣、偏痛、脈滿起，斜出尻脈，絡胸脅，支心貫膈，上肩加天突，斜下肩，交十椎下。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"臟俞五十穴。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"腑俞七十二穴","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"熱俞五十九穴","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"水俞五十七穴","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"頭上五行，行五，五五二十五穴。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"中〈月呂〉兩傍各五，凡十穴。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"大椎上兩傍各一，凡二穴。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"目瞳子浮白二穴。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"兩髀厭分中二穴。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"犢鼻二穴。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_19","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"耳中多所聞二穴。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_20","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"眉本二穴。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_21","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"完骨二穴。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_22","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"頂中央一穴。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_23","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"枕骨二穴。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_24","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"上關二穴。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_25","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"大迎二穴。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_26","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"下關二穴。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_27","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"天柱二穴。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_28","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"巨虛上下廉四穴。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_29","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"曲牙二穴。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_30","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"天突一穴。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_31","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"天府二穴。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_32","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"天牖二穴。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_33","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"扶突二穴。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_34","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"天窗二穴。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_35","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"肩解二穴。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_36","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"關元一穴。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_37","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"委陽二穴。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_38","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"肩貞二穴。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_39","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"喑門一穴。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_40","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"齊一穴。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_41","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"胸俞十二穴。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_42","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"背俞二穴。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_43","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"膺俞十二穴。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_44","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"分肉二穴。","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_45","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"踝上橫二穴。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_46","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"陰陽蹻四穴。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_47","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"水俞在諸分，熱俞在氣穴，寒熱俞在兩骸厭中二穴。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_48","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"大禁二十五在天府下五寸。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_49","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"凡三百六十五穴，針之所由行也。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_50","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"帝曰：餘已知氣穴之處，遊針之居，願聞孫絡溪穀，亦有所應乎？","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_51","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"岐伯曰：孫絡三百六十五穴會，亦以應一歲，以溢奇邪，以通榮衛。榮衛稽留，衛散榮溢，氣竭血著。外為發熱，內為少氣。疾瀉無怠，以通榮衛，見而瀉之，無問所會。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_52","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"帝曰：善。願聞溪穀之會也。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_53","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"岐伯曰：肉之大會為穀，肉之小會為溪，肉分之間，溪穀之會。以行榮衛，以會大氣。邪盛氣壅，脈熱肉敗，榮衛不行，必將為膿，內銷骨髓，外破大膕。留於節湊，必將為敗。積寒留舍，榮衛不居，捲肉縮筋，肋肘不得伸。內為骨痹，外為不仁，命曰不足，大寒留於溪穀也。溪穀三百六十五穴會。亦應一歲。其小痹淫溢，循脈往來，微針所及，與法相同。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_58_54","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_58","text":"帝乃避左右而起，再拜曰：今日發蒙解惑，藏之金匱，不敢復出。乃藏之金蘭之室，署曰氣穴所在。岐伯曰：孫絡之脈別經者，其血盛而當瀉者，亦三百六十五脈，並註於絡，傳註十二絡脈，非獨十四絡脈也，內解瀉於中者十脈。","sortOrder":54}],"overrides":{}}